OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 15 Sep to Thu 24 Sep
OL,6,FRemaining changeable, with occasional
OL,7,Frain or showers arriving from the
OL,8,FNorth Atlantic, most frequent across
OL,9,Fnorthern and western parts of the UK,
OL,10,Fwhere some strong winds will also be
OL,11,Fpossible at times. However, there will
OL,12,Falso be some reasonable dry and more
OL,13,Fsettled periods, especially across
OL,14,Fsouthern areas. Later in the month,
OL,15,Fhigh pressure may become more dominant
OL,16,Fin the vicinity of the UK, perhaps
OL,17,Fbringing more widely settled
OL,18,Fconditions for a time, especially away
OL,19,Ffrom the far north. Temperatures for
OL,20,Fthe period as a whole will probably be
OL,21,Fclose to average overall, but there is
OL,22,Fscope for some rather warm days at
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Ftimes, along with occasional
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Frelatively cool nights.
