OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 26 Sep to Sat 10 Oct
OL,6,FMost likely remaining changeable, with
OL,7,Ffurther spells of rain and showers
OL,8,Farriving from the North Atlantic.
OL,9,FStrong winds possible too at times,
OL,10,Fthese most frequent across the north
OL,11,Fand west. Some short-lived settled
OL,12,Fspells are also possible, these most
OL,13,Flikely in the south. Temperatures for
OL,14,Fthe period as a whole will probably be
OL,15,Fclose to average overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
